== Sauce ==

To make the sauce, whisk together the @garlic{1%clove}(minced), half the
@scallions{2}(sliced), @gochugaru (Korean chili flakes){2%teaspoons},
@maple syrup or sugar{2%teaspoons}, @soy sauce{2%tablespoons} and
@sesame oil{2%teaspoons}. Set aside while you fry the tofu.

== Tofu ==

Cut the @firm tofu{1%pound} into bite-sized pieces (24-36 pieces).

Place tofu on a #paper towel{}, top with a double layer of paper towels, and
press down gently to absorb surface moisture from the tofu. This will help the
tofu brown when you sauté it.

Heat @neutral high smoke point oil (such as canola, avocado or light olive){1/4%cup}
in a large #skillet{} over medium heat. Add as many tofu pieces as will fit in a
single layer and cook until golden on the bottom, then flip, ~{5-7%minutes} per
side. Transfer to a #serving plate{} and repeat with remaining tofu.

Pour sauce over tofu, sprinkle with remaining sliced @scallions{2}(sliced), and
serve warm.